cugpt NEWS — user-visible changes

Version 1.0 (2026-03-16)
  * Initial release.
  * microgpt.c: tape-based autograd C translation of Karpathy's microgpt.py.
    Zero dependencies beyond libc/libm. ~4x faster than Python baseline.
  * cugpt.c: manual backward pass with OpenBLAS-accelerated linear algebra.
    Eliminates autograd overhead; fastest C variant.
  * microgpt.py: original pure-Python reference implementation by Karpathy.
  * Benchmark suite comparing Python, microgpt.c, and cugpt.c across
    multiple compiler optimization flags.
